<title>USA: Wynne SD 9, Ark., won by First Tennessee.</title>
<headline>Wynne SD 9, Ark., won by First Tennessee.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Tennessee Bank said it won $1.800 million of Wynne SD 9, Ark., refunding and construction limited tax bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.243 percent.</p>
</text>
